Explore Emerald Zanzibar Resort & Spa and its stunning facilities, plan your visit and activities from your device before and during your visit. Use this app to start planning your stay, and ensure you don’t miss-out on any of the incredible experiences on offer at Emerald Zanzibar. During your stay the app provides the perfect travel companion, showing what’s on, providing you with fantastic inspiration from the recommended Must do list of experiences which you can book directly from the app.  Your itinerary is always accessible to see what adventures you have planned.  
A personal concierge in your pocket!
About the Resort:
Overlooking the picturesque Muyuni Beach in Matemwe, a completely pristine white sandy beach facing Mnemba Island, the Resort is located on a 10-hectares land that slopes down towards the coast with direct access to the sea and surrounded by an oval reef, which has been declared a marine conservation area
Boasting 250 Suites split into seven different categories, the Resort revisited the ethnic roots of Africa with a contemporary touch to include all modern comforts.
Use the app to help:
- Complete the check in registration requirements contactless;
- Explore the services and facilities available at the resort;
- Perfect your stay by booking restaurant tables, excursions and activities such as snorkelling, scuba diving or spa treatments;
- View the entertainment schedule for the upcoming week;
- Request to book any special events that you’d like to arrange for a loved one;
- Book your next stay at the resort.

The Save&Drive OMV  application is designed for all new and existing members of the Save&Drive  program who would like to keep up-to-date with all latest program features and to have their virtual card in the phone.
The application offers:
- Save&Drive VIRTUAL CARD for easy identification, replacing the plastic Save&Drive card for existing users;
- REGISTRATION VIA YOUR MOBILE PHONE for those who are not yet members of the Save&Drive program;
- INFORMATION ON THE CURRENT Save&Drive SPECIAL OFFERS available on filling stations;
- CONTACT FORM to the Contact Centre for any additional information;
- Fast and easy update and changes of user information in Save&Drive profile. 
As we seek to improve our application further through additional content, offers and services, we would like to thank you in advance for your constructive comments and suggestions.
More information about the Save&Drive  program of OMV in Bulgaria and the mobile application can be found on www.omv.bg/save-and-drive.
